  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the food security and resilience of host communities and returnees in Aweil East, Nasir, Pibor and Rubkona counties, South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the food security and resilience of host communities and returnees in Aweil East, Nasir, Pibor and Rubkona counties, South Sudan. This will be achieved through provision of livelihood kits to 31 600 (189 600 people) vulnerable host communities and returnees in the target counties.</narrative>
  </description>
